---
id: vitaminka-cabbage-carrot-salad
title: Classic Vitaminka Cabbage Salad
category: fresh_salad_veg

yield:
  servings: 4
  cooked_g: 822

storage:
  fridge_days: 4
  freezer_friendly: false

---

Shred @green-cabbage{0.5} into thin ribbons and coarsely grate @carrots{160%g}. Add both to a large mixing bowl.

Pour in @apple-cider-vinegar{2.5%tbsp} and @olive-oil{4%tsp}, then season with @kosher-salt{1%tsp} and @black-pepper{0.5%tsp}. Toss vigorously for 1 to 2 minutes until the cabbage wilts slightly.

Cover and rest ~rest-time{60%min} in the fridge so the vegetables release juice and absorb the dressing. Toss once more and serve chilled.
